  "reference_one_row_6144_to_2048": "cutlass_80_wmma_tensorop_s161616gemm_bf16_16x16_128x1 with split K: tensor-core K16 chains over slices of 1280,1280,1280,1280,1024 elements, FP32 slice sums added in slice order by cublasLt::splitKreduce_kernel, then one BF16 rounding.",
  "reference_two_rows": "cutlass_80_wmma_tensorop_bf16_s161616gemm_bf16_16x16_128x2: one tensor-core K16 chain, identical to the existing cuda-oxide kernel bit for bit; the 3072-to-1024 shape uses split K with sixteen 192-element slices summed in order."
 },
